floor rect  43  33  45  34  flat 13   # Z
floor rect  43  34  45  35  flat 12   # Z
floor rect  39  35  47  39  flat 12   # V

# the chute (SPEC.md 130.28): unfenced, its shape guides
chute 2 round depth 8 way 8 15 30 way 8 17 30 way 12 17 29

# rails: block rails (wall tiles) on the void side of each railed edge
wall  tile   7   8  flat 42
wall  tile   7   9  flat 42
wall  tile   7  10  flat 40
wall  tile   7  11  flat 38
wall  tile   7  12  flat 36
wall  tile   7  13  flat 34
guard tile   8   7                # see-through
wall  tile   9   8  flat 42
